# Force LF line endings for all text files so Windows checkouts don't break
# ruff format --check (which normalizes line endings) in CI / docker containers.
# Without this, `core.autocrlf=true` on Windows converts repo LF to CRLF in the
# working tree, ruff sees CRLF, flags every touched file as "would reformat",
# and CI fails on every PR. Symptom: `ruff format --diff` shows no content
# change but `ruff format --check` reports the file as needing reformat.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files — never line-end-normalize these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.tar binary
*.tgz binary
*.7z binary
*.parquet binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.otf binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.wav binary
*.so binary
*.dylib binary
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
